---
description: Lao full female name: GIVEN NAME FIRST, then the family name, separated by a single space (ສອນໄຊ ສີພັນດອນ). The space is genuine and load-bearing — Lao writes without spaces inside words, so the one space in a full name IS the field boundary between the two names. Remember that Lao sorts, addresses and indexes a person by the GIVEN name, so the FIRST half of this string is the key, not the second.
generator: tdc
locale: lo
---
<sequence name="p">
  <gen name="f" type="template" value="lo.person.female.firstName"/>
  <gen name="l" type="template" value="lo.person.lastName"/>
</sequence>
<data>${{p.f}} ${{p.l}}</data>
